        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Brunella-Token",
              "value": "bas_wh_T4jyIMGwAugmWqJhRrZb6EYax358C01t_2026"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"client_name\": \"{{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"client_name\"] || $node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"brand_name\"]}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"email\"] || $node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"contact_email\"]}}\",\n  \"industry\": \"{{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"industry\"]}}\",\n  \"pain_point\": \"{{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"pain_point\"]}}\",\n  \"form_type\": \"{{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"form_type\"]}}\",\n  \"manual_hours\": \"{{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"manual_hours\"]}}\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Forward to Brunella",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        550,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "headerAuth": {
          "id": "brunella-token",
          "name": "Brunella Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "peter@pohankaestarsa.com",
        "toEmail": "={{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"email\"] || $node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"contact_email\"]}}",
        "subject": "Visszaigazolás: Brunella Onboarding folyamat elindult",
        "html": "<h3>Kedves {{$node[\"Webhook Trigger\"].json[\"client_name\"]}}!</h3><p>Köszönjük a megkeresést. Az AI ágensünk megkezdte a folyamatok elemzését. Hamarosan jelentkezünk a javaslatokkal.</p>",
